The Russian morphology dictionary files in ../dicts/ are the unchanged runtime
dictionary files distributed with Az.js 0.2.3. Az.js dicts/meta.json identifies
their source as OpenCorpora (opencorpora.org), source version 0.92, revision
394551, compiled on 2016-04-14. The metadata file is not a runtime asset.

OpenCorpora identifies its morphological dictionary as CC BY-SA 3.0:
https://opencorpora.org/?page=downloads
License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Attribution: OpenCorpora — open Russian-language morphological dictionary.
The Az.js package compiled this dictionary into the DAWG/array/JSON files
copied here; this integration has not modified those files.
